stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  state "Assessed<br/>Three reviewers score" as Assessed
  state "Ready to apply" as Ready
  state "Risky<br/>Suggest not applying" as Risky
  state "Tuning<br/>Only rewords facts the resume shows<br/>No new numbers, tools or titles<br/>Gaps marked needs_confirmation" as Tuning
  state "Log application" as Logged
  state "Choose another job" as Other
  state "Ceiling reached<br/>Fine-tune disabled until a revised<br/>resume is uploaded<br/>Add real experience, or choose another job" as Ceiling
  [*] --> Assessed: Paste a JD
  Assessed --> Ready: Average 80+<br/>and lowest 70+
  Assessed --> Risky: Average below 60
  Assessed --> Tuning: Below that,<br/>average 60+
  Ready --> Logged
  Risky --> Other
  Risky --> Tuning: Tune anyway
  Tuning --> Assessed: Accept changes, re-assess
  Tuning --> Ceiling: No evidence-backed<br/>change left, or<br/>gain under 1 point
